{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 12 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">去噪与图像恢复：残差、盲点与长程建模的假设边界</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Denoising &amp; Restoration</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_116_restormer-title\">Restormer</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">Restormer 用 MDTA 在通道维做转置注意力，并以 GDFN 门控深度卷积替代普通 Transformer FFN。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Replaces spatial N×N self-attention with Multi-Dconv Head Transposed Attention (MDTA) across channels (C×C) paired with a Gated-Dconv Feed-Forward Network (GDFN).</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">高分辨率受退化图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">High-resolution degraded image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">去噪、去雨、去模糊等恢复图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Restored high-resolution image</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2022/html/Zamir_Restormer_Efficient_Transformer_for_High-Resolution_Image_Restoration_CVPR_2022_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_116_restormer')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_116_restormer')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Restormer original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/6045910651ee06368b1d.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_116_restormer', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_116_restormer\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_116_restormer')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_116_restormer', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_116_restormer\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">退化高分辨率图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">保持原空间网格输入</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests high-resolution degraded image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"保持原空间网格输入\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests high-resolution degraded image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"退化高分辨率图像\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_116_restormer', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">退化高分辨率图像</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">保持原空间网格输入</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests high-resolution degraded image and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"3×3 卷积生成重叠局部 token，不做硬切块\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Overlapped patch embedding to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Overlapped patch embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"Overlapped patch embedding\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_116_restormer', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Overlapped patch embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">3×3 卷积生成重叠局部 token，不做硬切块</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Overlapped patch embedding to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐级降采样、增加通道并积累多尺度上下文\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs hierarchical encoder within the core channel transposed attention restormer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"四级层级 encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"hierarchical encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_116_restormer', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">四级层级 encoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">hierarchical encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐级降采样、增加通道并积累多尺度上下文</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs hierarchical encoder within the core channel transposed attention restormer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"Multi-Dconv Head Transposed Attention 在通道维计算注意力，Q/K/V 前含 depthwise conv\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs MDTA within the core channel transposed attention restormer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"MDTA\" data-node-name-en=\"MDTA\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_116_restormer', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>MDTA</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">Multi-Dconv Head Transposed Attention 在通道维计算注意力，Q/K/V 前含 depthwise conv</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs MDTA within the core channel transposed attention restormer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"门控 depthwise-conv 前馈网络同时建模局部结构和通道选择\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs GDFN within the core channel transposed attention restormer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"GDFN\" data-node-name-en=\"GDFN\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_116_restormer', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>GDFN</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">门控 depthwise-conv 前馈网络同时建模局部结构和通道选择</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs GDFN within the core channel transposed attention restormer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐级上采样并融合 encoder 同尺度 skip\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs symmetric multi-scale decoder within the core channel transposed attention restormer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"对称多尺度 decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"symmetric multi-scale decoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_116_restormer', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">对称多尺度 decoder</span><span class=\"lang-en\">symmetric multi-scale decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐级上采样并融合 encoder 同尺度 skip</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs symmetric multi-scale decoder within the core channel transposed attention restormer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"输出前继续在原尺度细化纹理\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies refinement blocks to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"高分辨率 refinement blocks\" data-node-name-en=\"refinement blocks\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_116_restormer', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">高分辨率 refinement blocks</span><span class=\"lang-en\">refinement blocks</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输出前继续在原尺度细化纹理</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies refinement blocks to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预测残差与输入相加得到 clean 图像\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces restored high-resolution image via residual output.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"残差恢复输出\" data-node-name-en=\"residual output\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_116_restormer', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">残差恢复输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">residual output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预测残差与输入相加得到 clean 图像</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces restored high-resolution image via residual output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Restormer Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 跨通道转置注意力的高分辨率恢复</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Linear-Complexity Channel-Wise Transposed Attention (MDTA) + Gated Depthwise FFN (GDFN)</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Restormer：核心公式 · 跨通道转置注意力的高分辨率恢复\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"116\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"17.865756pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.892107 -69.00913 239.623675 17.865756\" width=\"239.623675pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M7.007346 0V-.188583C6.560702-.218359 6.461448-.317613 6.114059-1.052094L3.642629-6.689733H3.444121L1.379633-1.816352C.744406-.367241 .625301-.218359 .148881-.188583V0H2.114114V-.188583C1.637694-.188583 1.439186-.317613 1.439186-.595525C1.439186-.71463 1.468962-.853586 1.518589-.982617L1.975159-2.143891H4.575619L4.982561-1.19105C5.101666-.913139 5.171144-.665003 5.171144-.516122C5.171144-.426793 5.111591-.317613 5.032188-.277912C4.913083-.208434 4.