x=\"77.555197\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g17-38\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"85.226423\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g11-157\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"89.878976\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g17-85\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"96.225177\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g5-17\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use><use x=\"100.76811\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g5-105\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use><use x=\"106.742312\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g17-150\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"123.879631\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g21-94\" y=\"-59.472003\"></use><use x=\"121.115029\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g17-32\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"131.580732\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g21-94\" y=\"-59.686211\"></use><use x=\"128.41761\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g17-38\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"139.055425\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g11-50\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"147.361976\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g0-82\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"153.934326\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g14-24\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"160.308861\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g8-2\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use><use x=\"165.152487\" xlink:href=\"#m116_g14-24\" y=\"-61.559162\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">标准自注意力对像素数呈二次复杂度，难处理大图</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Even windowed spatial self-attention restricted receptive fields or incurred heavy memory overhead on megapixel medical scans.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用通道维 transposed attention 和门控深度卷积前馈网络恢复高分辨率图像</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Compute cross-covariance attention across feature channels (C×C instead of HW×HW) after applying 3×3 depthwise convolutions for local spatial context.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在线性空间复杂度下兼顾全局通道交互与局部空间建模</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">O(HW · C²) linear spatial scaling via MDTA + element-wise gated depthwise convolutional FFN controlling fine detail propagation.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">适合高分辨率病理、CT/MRI 去噪和运动伪影校正</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Well-suited for high-resolution digital pathology restoration, whole-slice MRI motion correction, and low-dose CT denoising.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">高效 restoration 基线；医学成像算子和不确定性仍需额外约束</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Compute-efficient high-resolution Transformer restorer; must be audited for quantitative intensity preservation.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把注意力矩阵转到通道维，避免随像素数二次增长。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">Q/K/V 与 FFN 都嵌入 depthwise 卷积，让全局通道交互保留局部空间归纳偏置。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">层级 encoder-decoder、同尺度 skip 和原尺度 refinement 协同恢复细节。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Compute cross-covariance attention across feature channels (C×C instead of HW×HW) after applying 3×3 depthwise convolutions for local spatial context.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: O(HW · C²) linear spatial scaling via MDTA + element-wise gated depthwise convolutional FFN controlling fine detail propagation.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Linear-Complexity Channel-Wise Transposed Attention (MDTA) + Gated Depthwise FFN (GDFN).</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">对高分辨率病理、CT/MRI 去噪和运动伪影校正具有较好计算可扩展性。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">MDTA 是通道统计而非物理数据一致性；定量医学重建仍需显式测量约束或残差验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Well-suited for high-resolution digital pathology restoration, whole-slice MRI motion correction, and low-dose CT denoising.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Compute-efficient high-resolution Transformer restorer; must be audited for quantitative intensity preservation.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/CVPR2022/html/Zamir_Restormer_Efficient_Transformer_for_High-Resolution_Image_Restoration_CVPR_2022_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Restormer: Efficient Transformer for High-Resolution Image Restoration</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/swz30/Restormer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
